1
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,280
牛排五分钟后就好
Steaks will be ready in five minutes.

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,539
你这是在暴殄天物
You're destroying those things.

3
00:00:05,539 --> 00:00:07,620
-杰 少点意见 -恕难从命
- Ay, Jay, leave him alone. - No, I'm sorry,

4
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,220
那头牛已经吃够了苦头
but that cow has suffered long enough.

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,580
-真幽默 -等等
- Fun. - Wait.

6
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,300
别玩了 晚饭马上就好
Hang on. Dinner's ready in five minutes.

7
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,220
教练布置我们练习带球上篮
Coach wants us to practice layups.

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,780
超难的动作 是舞蹈与力量的怪混搭
They are deceptively hard- a curious mix of dance and strength.

9
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,080
-你这又把档次拉低了 -抱歉
- You're making it lame again. - Sorry.

10
00:00:21,961 --> 00:00:24,820
-天啊 那个教练 -我讨厌那家伙
- Ay, Dios mio, that coach. - Oh, I hate that guy.

11
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,480
他激发了俩小子的积极性
He seems to have the kids motivated.

12
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,020
爸 你没亲眼见过那家伙
Oh, Dad, you haven't seen him.

13
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:29,500
他对小家伙们又是讽又是骂
He taunts the kids. He's abusive.

14
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,660
这要是在哥伦比亚足联 老早之前
Listen, if this was a Colombian soccer league, long time ago,

15
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:34,860
队里孩子就会把他拉出去 咔嚓
one of the kids would have taken that guy out and-

16
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:37,360
教练本就该严格要求他们
A coach is supposed to ride the kids hard.

17
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:39,660
-菲尔 你说句话 -那家伙过分了
- Phil, help me out here. - He's a mean man.

18
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,997
-你真是妇人之仁 -你去看场比赛就明白了
-Oh, you're such a woman. - Come to the game. You'll see.

19
00:00:41,997 --> 00:00:43,540
那家伙真的很操蛋
This guy's a real motherscratcher.

20
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:44,500
原谅我的脏话 歌洛莉亚
Pardon the language, Gloria.

21
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:45,520
只对歌洛莉亚说吗
"Gloria"?

22
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,360
他最好淡定点
He better cool it,

23
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,680
否则就别怪左将军和右元帅出手了
or I'm gonna introduce him to the Captain and Tennille.

24
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:53,181
不好意思 迟了 我工作缠身
Sorry we're late. I was at work.

25
00:00:53,181 --> 00:00:55,394
-他最近爱念工作 -烧烤快乐
- Oh, he loves to say that. - And happy barbecue.

26
00:00:55,394 --> 00:00:57,295
自从米奇尔待业家中
Oh. Since Mitchell is between jobs,

27
00:00:57,380 --> 00:01:00,320
我就在一家贺卡店找了份兼职
I've taken a part-time job at a greeting card store,

28
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,440
我爱死这份工作了
which I love.

29
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:03,720
还有 因为我有员工折扣
Plus, with my discount,

30
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:05,160
我们可省下了一笔
we're saving a fortune.

31
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:10,660
花一大笔钱去买贺卡 哪里算省钱了
How is spending a ton of money on greeting cards saving us a fortune?

32
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,840
算算就知道了
It's math.

33
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,840
才不是 我算给你看
It's really not. Look it up.

34
00:01:19,641 --> 00:01:20,328
-六折 -2.95美元
- Forty percent off. - 2.95.

35
00:01:20,366 --> 00:01:22,472
-3.95美元 -六折 六折
-3.95. - Forty percent off. Forty percent off.

36
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:25,360
米奇尔 我有个高尔夫球友
Mitchell, I got this golf buddy of mine.

37
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,840
人不错 事业有成 你们找机会谈谈
Great guy. Super successful. You two should talk.

38
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,140
没准他有适合你的工作
It could mean a job for you.

39
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:30,364
谢了 爸 但是我
Oh, thanks, Dad, but I'm-

40
00:01:30,557 --> 00:01:32,280
我现阶段还没找工作的打算
I'm not really looking for anything right now.

41
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,240
-不过 -对 没错
- But- - Yeah, that's right.

42
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:34,200
有我挣钱养家
With me bringing home the bacon,

43
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,720
米奇尔不急着找工作
Mitchell doesn't have to rush into anything.

44
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:38,680
我知道你们那个只要贺卡不要钱计划
Yeah, I know you have all that greeting card "Screw you" Money,

45
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,520
但 跟这家伙谈谈
but, uh, talk to the guy?

46
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:41,780
我跟他说 你明早会给他电话
He's expecting your call in the morning.

47
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:44,113
-爸 我心领了 但以后 -受不了了
Dad, I appreciate it, but in the future- I can't stand this.

48
00:01:44,113 --> 00:01:45,960
对不起 但是我
I am sorry, but I-

49
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:48,601
不行 那几块牛排五分钟前就烤好了
No. Those steaks have been done for five minutes.

50
00:01:48,601 --> 00:01:49,896
我得把它们从烤架上夹下来
I'm taking 'em off the grill.

51
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,880
不好意思 你的心情我懂
I'm sorry. I know how it feels

52
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,584
什么事他都要插上一脚
to have him stick his nose where it doesn't belong.

53
00:01:55,584 --> 00:01:57,625
没什么 又不是第一次了
No biggie. It's just Jay being Jay.

54
00:01:57,931 --> 00:01:59,380
总有一天我也会为人岳父
But one day I'm gonna be a grandfather,

55
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:01,280
到时各位最好都把自个儿的"肉"藏好了
and then everybody better hide their meat.

56
00:02:18,471 --> 00:02:19,576
这美女是谁
Ooh. Who's she?

57
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,360
一点都不好笑
I hate it when you do that.

58
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,440
-这帅哥是谁 -查理·宾格温
- Who's he? - It's Charlie Bingham.

59
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,000
就是我爸让我联系的那个人
He's the guy that my dad wanted me to call.

60
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,280
我搜了他 看
I googled him. Look.

61
00:02:26,979 --> 00:02:28,300
他是"地球人"服装企业的老板
Oh, he owns Earthgear Apparel.

62
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:29,314
我的滑雪裤就是这牌子的
I have their ski pants.

63
00:02:29,314 --> 00:02:31,700
是吗 你又 你又不滑雪
Really? You don't- You don't ski.

64
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:33,760
我有好几件工装裤 我也没在码头上班呀
I have cargo pants and I don't work at the docks.

65
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:35,820
天啊 真是让我自惭形秽
God, I feel like such a slacker.

66
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,140
他年纪轻轻就已大有作为
I mean, he has done so much for being so young.

67
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,900
你看 他创立了不少
Okay, look. He's opened up a dozen

68
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:41,980
环保基金会和管理委员会
environmental foundations and conservancies.

69
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:44,700
-真牛 -那你要给他电话了
- Wow. - So, you gonna- you gonna call him?

70
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,981
我没想好 你知道的
I don't know. I mean, you know,

71
00:02:46,981 --> 00:02:48,963
我们之前说好了的
I sort of promised myself and you...

72
00:02:48,963 --> 00:02:50,620
我先休息一段时间 而且
that I'd take a little time off, and-

73
00:02:50,620 --> 00:02:52,840
-而且你也享受这份闲暇 -没错
- And you are loving your time off. - Totally.

74
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,640
我快要抓狂了
I am losing my mind.

75
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,440
虽然我爱莉莉
As much as I love Lily-

76
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:01,597
把她看得比什么都重
which is, you know, more than life itself-

77
00:03:01,597 --> 00:03:05,961
我 没办法做个居家奶爸
I am- whoo- not cut out to be a stay-at-home dad.

78
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,500
但该轮到卡梅隆了
No, but it's Cameron's turn.

79
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:09,220
该轮到他到外面
It's Cameron's turn to be out in the world...

80
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:11,820
跟其他成年人打交道 而我待在家里
interacting with other grown-ups while I get to stay at home...

81
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:14,173
把《爱探险的朵拉》游戏给解决掉
and-and plot the death of Dora the Explorer.

82
00:03:16,486 --> 00:03:18,365
比如拿砖头塞满她背包
Like to fill her backpack with bricks

83
00:03:18,365 --> 00:03:20,103
再把她扔进拐杖糖河里
and throw her into Candy Cane River.

84
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:23,440
我不知道 我应该 应该打给他吗
So, I don't know. Should I- Should I call him?

85
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,745
我觉得 打了让你爸死心也好
I don't know. Maybe just to get your dad off your back.

86
00:03:25,745 --> 00:03:26,820
-没错 没错 -我觉得
- Yeah. Yeah. - I mean,

87
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:29,800
我可不想你现在去上班
because the last thing I want for you is to take a job right now.

88
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:32,180
我对现状很满意
I am loving our life.

89
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:34,660
我正陷入绝境
I am in a really dark space.

90
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:37,460
与莉莉分开简直像酷刑一样
Being away from my Lily is literally torture.

91
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,420
但我又不能给米奇尔压力
And I can't pressure Mitchell,

92
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:43,120
但我真的真的真的想他快点再就业
but I really, really, really just want him to get a job...

93
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:46,708
这样我又能做回居家奶爸兼贤妻了
so I can go back to being a stay-at-home dad/trophy wife!

94
00:03:49,414 --> 00:03:50,585
小子 加油
Guys, come on!

95
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,880
加把劲 姑娘们 跑起来
Come on, ladies! Move it!

96
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,520
天啊 乌龟都比你们爬得快
Goodness gracious! Turtles run faster!

97
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:56,920
跑起来
Come on!

98
00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:58,720
你还能跑得再慢一点吗
Could you run any slower?

99
00:03:58,740 --> 00:04:00,219
我敢说你们跑得更慢都行
I dare you to run slower!

100
00:04:00,219 --> 00:04:02,184
-你看 -他不过是在激发大家斗志
- You see? - He's just trying to light a fire.

101
00:04:02,184 --> 00:04:04,064
待会儿我就把丫给"治"了
Oh, I'll light him on fire!

102
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:06,300
为什么老是要我来看这玩意儿
Why do I always have to come to these things?

103
00:04:06,540 --> 00:04:07,900
因为你爱你弟弟
Because you love your brother.

104
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:11,079
那为什么你不让他来我的管弦音乐会
Why don't you make him come to my orchestra concerts?

105
00:04:11,079 --> 00:04:14,349
因为我们爱你弟 好样的卢克
Because we love your brother. Good job, Luke.

106
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:16,660
投篮
Shoot!

107
00:04:17,505 --> 00:04:20,840
迪尔加多 你是要把我气死吗
Delgado, you're killing me, man!

108
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:23,240
不管怎样我都爱你 曼尼
I love you, Manny, no matter what!

109
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,140
跑起来
Come on!

110
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:29,257
好 很好
Okay. That's great.

111
00:04:29,257 --> 00:04:31,117
好的 我再给你回复 对
Okay, well, I'll let you know. Right.

112
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:32,120
就这样 再见
All right. Bye.

113
00:04:32,785 --> 00:04:35,847
查理·宾格温邀请我们
Uh, so, Charlie Bingham just invited us over...

114
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,340
去他的海边别墅聊聊
to his beach house for a little get-together.

115
00:04:37,608 --> 00:04:39,943
是嘛 你是怎么答复他的
Oh. Uh, what did you say?

116
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,700
我说我先跟你商量下
I said I'd check with you.

117
00:04:41,888 --> 00:04:43,126
你觉得要去吗
I mean, what do you think?

118
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,640
你觉得呢
What do you think?

119
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,960
我觉得推掉人家的盛情邀请不大礼貌
Well, I think it'd be rude not to hear him out.

120
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,282
-没错 是这样 -没错
- Yeah. I mean, yeah. You're probably right. - Yeah.

121
00:04:51,282 --> 00:04:52,780
-那就去 -好
- Okay. - Cool.

122
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:55,560
别过虑了 我不会再就业的
And don't worry. You know, I'm not gonna take any job.

123
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,640
你最好不要
You better not.

124
00:04:59,766 --> 00:05:00,948
我太想
I just miss-

125
00:05:01,678 --> 00:05:02,644
我
I just-

126
00:05:03,421 --> 00:05:05,389
我
I just-

127
00:05:07,975 --> 00:05:11,283
我太想 我的烤奶酪三明治了
I just miss... my grilled cheese sandwiches!

128
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:13,780
表现不错 卢克
You're doing great, Luke-

129
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:15,247
如果是比谁打得烂得话
if your goal is to suck!

130
00:05:15,247 --> 00:05:16,700
-菲尔 你 -我出手
- Phil, you- - I'm on it.

131
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:17,220
-好 -等等我
- Okay. - Wait for me.

132
00:05:18,660 --> 00:05:19,377
-教练 -什么
- Hey, Coach. - Yeah?

133
00:05:19,377 --> 00:05:21,480
你指导很投入很激情
Uh, look. We appreciate your passion,

134
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:23,059
但是我们担心
but some of us are worried that

135
00:05:23,059 --> 00:05:24,480
嚷嚷可能会起反效果
the yelling is getting counterproductive.

136
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,300
我心里有数 跑 笨蛋
I got this. Come on, stupid!

137
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:29,240
不 你没 你有的只是烂态度
No, you don't "Got this." What you got is a bad attitude.

138
00:05:30,860 --> 00:05:31,520
你哪位
Who are you?

139
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:34,280
我是家长 就是那个
I happen to be the stepfather of-

140
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:39,980
我是谁不重要 你要做的是
Doesn't matter who. What you need to start doing...

141
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:43,040
多一些指导 少一些嚷嚷
is a little more coaching and a little less yelling.

142
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,980
因为我要是再听见你叫他们笨蛋
'Cause if I hear you call one of these kids stupid again,

143
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:48,560
我发誓 我会脱鞋对着你的脑袋砸
I swear to God, I'll throw a shoe at your head.

144
00:05:49,340 --> 00:05:51,300
操 我才懒得教
Screw it. I don't need this.

145
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:52,760
你觉得你能教得比我好
You think you can do a better job?

146
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,200
你来教啊
You coach.

147
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,379
杰 我刚在跟他谈呢
Jay, you know, I was handling it.

148
00:05:58,379 --> 00:06:00,960
对 我注意到你的小左和小右爆发了
Yeah, I saw how you broke out Peaches and Herb.

149
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,040
是左将军和
It's the Captain and-

150
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:10,080
听着 你们之前的教练要离开一段时间
Okay. So, your old coach had to leave for a little while.

151
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,940
为什么 他病了吗
Why? Is he sick?

152
00:06:11,940 --> 00:06:14,600
-对 他病得很严重 -那他会死吗
- Yes. He's very, very sick. - Is he going to die?

153
00:06:14,780 --> 00:06:17,000
人皆有一死 孩子们 现在关注当下
Everybody dies, boys. Let's focus on what's important.

154
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:19,000
一小时后下场就开始了
Our next game is in one hour.

155
00:06:19,020 --> 00:06:22,500
我们要团结一致 重拳出击
We are going to go from being five fingers to being a fist.

156
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,980
-怎么样 -好
- How does that sound? - Great.

157
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,899
-听不到 -好
- I can't hear you. - Great!

158
00:06:25,899 --> 00:06:27,921
就是这样
That's what I'm talkin' 'bout!

159
00:06:27,921 --> 00:06:30,293
各位 我刚和裁判谈过了 我来执教
All right, gentlemen. I talked to the referee. I'm coaching.

160
00:06:30,548 --> 00:06:33,788
-但是我 -菲尔 我以前教过橄榄球
- Oh, really? 'Cause I- - Phil, I coached football.

161
00:06:34,085 --> 00:06:35,800
杰 我之前教过篮球
Jay, I actually coached basketball.

162
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,680
我觉得我能让小家伙们
I think I can get these guys-

163
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,800
别急 让你当助理
Relax. You've already got the assistant job.

164
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,620
现在去给我们带几瓶水好吗
Now you think you can round us up some waters?

165
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:43,940
-好 -去吧
- Yeah. - Go ahead.

166
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,260
伙计们 你们要这样
Gentlemen, this is what I need.

167
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:49,255
我要你们把他们打败 打得落花流水
I want you to hit 'em, and I want you to hit 'em hard.

168
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:50,420
跟岳父相处真不易
Father-in-laws are tough,

169
00:06:50,563 --> 00:06:52,420
因为既不能让他对你呼来喝去
because you can't let 'em push you around...

170
00:06:52,420 --> 00:06:54,300
